; Export names must match the game's DllImport EntryPoint values exactly and be
; undecorated. x64 __declspec(dllexport) already yields undecorated names for
; extern "C", but pinning them here makes the ABI contract explicit and stops a
; future calling-convention change from silently renaming an export.
LIBRARY WheelFfb
EXPORTS
    InitDirectInput
    Aquire
    SetDeviceForcesXY
    StartEffect
    StopEffect
    SetAutoCenter
    FreeDirectInput
    SetPreferredDevice
    SetPreferredDeviceGuid
    SetPreferredDeviceIndex
    EnumerateDevices
    GetDeviceName
    EnumerateAllDevices
    GetAnyDeviceName
    OpenAuxDevice
    ReadAuxButtons
    CloseAuxDevice
    OpenReadDevice
    ReadDeviceState
    ReadDeviceStateWithPov
    CloseReadDevices
    GetDeviceInfo
    GetDeviceGuid
    GetAnyDeviceGuid
    GetAnyDeviceInfo
    PanicStop
    ZeroForces
    InstallExitGuards
    SetHoldTimeoutMs
    SetLogPath
    GetLastHResult
    GetWheelFfbVersion
    CreatePeriodicEffect
    UpdatePeriodicEffect
    ReleasePeriodicEffects
    CreateConditionEffect
    UpdateConditionEffect
    ReleaseConditionEffects
    SetStrictDeviceSelection
    CreatePeriodicBurst
    PlayPeriodicBurst
    StopPeriodicBurst

    PlayShapedPeriodicBurst

    CreateConstantBurst
    PlayConstantBurst
    StopConstantBurst
    ReleaseConstantBursts
    ExternalFfbEnter
    ExternalFfbOpen
    ExternalFfbArm
    ExternalFfbRenewClient
    ExternalFfbSubmitConstant
    ExternalFfbDisarm
    ExternalFfbClose
    ExternalFfbGetStatus
    EnableTestInjection
    SubmitTestInjection
    GetTestInjectionStatus
    LastReadInjected
